。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性恐怖症の気があり、それもまたクラスに溶け込めない一因となっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66418"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a6516212b2cd5dd11c8ecb9c53a53fd6f7e14117ea05b57d067a691600dfbf5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6fafcc30932d3b6b3a2818ca53e98a4782d76fce9dc438d72d2007f62f591070.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"生天目仁美","creatorId":"vndb:s270","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s270","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s270","name":"生天目 仁美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:262240:66418:4394:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1993","characterName":"真伏 恭子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"262240"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25922"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1993"},"originalCharacterName":"真伏 恭子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラス担任。歴史の教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"授業はくわえタバコ、授業の半分は自習で済ますといった、あまりやる気を感じられないぐうたら教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過激な下ネタで男子学生をからかうのが趣味。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25922","sourceWorkId":"7011","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が通うことになる学校の教師。担任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"専攻は歴史。くわえタバコで授業、さらに一週間の半分を自習で済ませるようなぐうたら教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過激な下ネタで男子学生たちをからかったりするのが楽しいらしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66424"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f14e282cda78ac3f6bc0d7a3052e9f2151404a8c1f0a4595f1fbb20b6565dc7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f1d4acaf392adb9149cb8c5e3f9717177ff4ff747de5b149e8bd66111590a289.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅川悠","creatorId":"vndb:s81","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s81","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s81","name":"浅川 悠","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:262240:66424:3958:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1995","characterName":"牧野 真琴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66420","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"262240"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25918"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1995"},"originalCharacterName":"牧野 真琴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の先輩。地元の神社の娘で、巫女として奉仕している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、礼節や作法がしっかりしていて、落ち着いた雰囲気を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オカルト好きでオカルト研究部に所属しているが、武術にも秀で、弓道部も掛け持ちしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25918","sourceWorkId":"7011","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の先輩。見た目通りの大和撫子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"武術に秀で、礼節や作法もしっかりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元の神社の娘で巫女。オカルト関係が大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弓道部との掛け持ちでオカルト研究会にも所属しているが、本人的にはむしろオカルト研究会の方が本命。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66420"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/088acac8bff0c904af1c0fb017976d302323eb82fe1de609072679c73e757db6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/9437d829ab9524606f4a6d6e65ab71ec80b56f0d60388451abc8fe064d90405c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高口幸子","creatorId":"vndb:s261","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s261","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s261","name":"高口幸子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:262240:66420:4838:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"秋野 もみじ","creatorId":"vndb:s777","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s777","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s777","name":"吉住 梢","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:38028","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1996","characterName":"川原 凛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66419","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"262240"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25917"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1996"},"originalCharacterName":"川原 凛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の同級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校では丘の上のお屋敷に住む富豪の令嬢として振舞っているが、実はそれは過去の話。現在は親の借金のため、かつての屋敷内にある使用人の小屋に住み込み、メイドとしてこき使われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プライドの高い、キツメのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また現実主義者で、超常現象はまったく信じない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25917","sourceWorkId":"7011","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の同級生。性格はキツめのお嬢様タイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校では丘のお屋敷に住む富豪令嬢として振る舞っているが、それも過去の話で、実際は敷地内にある使用人小屋に住み込むメイドの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて住んでいた屋敷で、借金のカタにメイドとしてこき使われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現実主義者で、超常現象の一切が嫌い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66419"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f8e098c01a84a59954733fc7bffb959fe69982d0fa0cc52ec48ece52bce3a6be.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d51530365f3abf67909faf3a75f32affde077c719dfe56dd589bdcf7c2034ad.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"入広瀬巴","creatorId":"vndb:s6020","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6020","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6020","name":"入広瀬巴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:38032","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1997","characterName":"アル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66421","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"262240"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25919"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1997"},"originalCharacterName":"アル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞台となる常若の森に住む妖精の一人。主人公の同居人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明朗快活で人懐っこく、子供っぽい性格。また寂しがり屋で甘えん坊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能天気に振舞っているが、自分が妖精として落ちこぼれであるという軽いコンプレックスを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その背中には羽を持っているが、自力では飛べず、「パサラ」というUFOを使って飛んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25919","sourceWorkId":"7011","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"常若の森に住む妖精のひとり。主人公の同居人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寂しがりやで甘えん坊。人懐っこく、素直。無防備で明るい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何の妖精だか、生まれて数年、未だにわからない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく能天気な姿からは想像できないが、自分が落ちこぼれであるという軽いコンプレックスを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"羽根を持っているが自力では飛べず、パサラというUFOに乗っかって飛行する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66421"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b233233aca8b29c19e07cf80812b9ed5201aa414b9f8bedcc53aab9193e8830.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a19f7480740e24cac72bbe2042ad6446d91432fa7d5cba4d5f1862b991bc5b1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天神有海","creatorId":"vndb:s800","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s800","canonicalEnti